  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>형<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>졘<ruby>걀<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gD14iiXq7Xw?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>火車<rt>훼ˆ챠ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>漸漸<rt>쟘쟘ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>起行<rt>키ˆ걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    huê-chiâ jiam-jiām lêh-khî-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>再會<rt>재ˋ훼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>故鄉<rt>거ˋ형ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>親情<rt>친ˉ쟐ˊ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jài-huē goà’e kòr-hiông kâh-chīn-jiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>親愛<rt>친ˉ애</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>爸母<rt>베뿌ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>再會<rt>재ˋ훼ˉ</rt></ruby>’밯\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chīn-ai’e pe-bù jài-huē’pah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>鬥陣<rt>ᄃᅷˋ딘ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>朋友<rt>볭유ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>告辭<rt>고ˋ시ˊ</rt></ruby>’랗\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tàu-tīn’e pieng-yù kò-sí’lah\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來去<rt>래킈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>台北<rt>대박</rt></ruby> <ruby>拍拚<rt>팧ˆ뱔</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà bêh-lai-khì-tai-pak phâh-pia̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>聽人講<rt>턀ˉ랑겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>好<rt>호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>康<rt>캉ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>햐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thiā̰-lang-kông-siâ̰-mîh hô-khâng’e lông-ti-hiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>朋友<rt>볭유ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>笑<rt>쵸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛<rt>애ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>做<rt>죄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>眠夢<rt>삔빵ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>慐囝<rt>껑걀ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pieng-yù chiò-goà si-ài-joè-bin-bāng’e gong-kià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>管<rt>관ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>如何<rt>뚜호ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>家己<rt>가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>行<rt>걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-koân-ru-hó lōr si-kā-kī kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿! <ruby>再會<rt>재ˋ훼ˉ</rt></ruby>’밯!\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh! jài-huē’pah!\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿! <ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh! siâ̰-mîh lông-m-kiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿! <ruby>再會<rt>재ˋ훼ˉ</rt></ruby>’밯!\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh! jài-huē’pah!\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿! <ruby>向前行<rt>형ˋ졘걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh! hiòng-jien-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>車站<rt>챠ˉ잠ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一站<rt>짇잠-</rt></ruby><ruby>一站<rt>짇잠ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>過<rt>궤</rt></ruby>’킈랗\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiā-jām jit-jam-jit-jām kue’khi-lah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>風景<rt>헝ˉ곙ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一幕<rt>짇뻐-</rt></ruby><ruby>一幕<rt>짇뻐ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>電影<rt>뎬얄ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hōng-kièng jit-bor-jit-bōr chīn-chiṵ-tien-yà̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    가<ruby>家己<rt>가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>當做<rt>덩ˉ죄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>男主角<rt>람주ˆ각</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>搬<rt>봘ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ka-kā-kī tōng-joè-si-lam-jû-kak lai-poâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>雲遊四海<rt>훈유수ˋ해ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>可比<rt>코ˆ비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>小飛俠<rt>ㄒㄧㄠㄈㄟㄒㄧㄚˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hun-yu-sù-hài khô-pî-si-<i>xiǎo fēi xiá</i>\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>管<rt>관ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>幼稚<rt>유ˋ디ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>抑<rt>얗</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>樂觀<rt>럭관ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-koân-si-yù-tī yah-si-lork-koân\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>後果<rt>효고ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나-</rt></ruby><ruby>按怎<rt>안ˆ좔ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>家己<rt>가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>擔<rt>달ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hio-kò na-ân-joà̰ kā-kī tio-lai-tâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>原諒<rt>꽌령-</rt></ruby><ruby>不孝<rt>붇ˆᄒᅷ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>囝兒<rt>걀ˆ띠ˊ</rt></ruby>’밯\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goan-liong-pût-hau’e kiâ̰-rí’pah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>趁<rt>탄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>猶<rt>얗ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>少年<rt>ᄉᆤˋ롄ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>趕緊<rt>괄ˆ긴ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>拍拚<rt>팧ˆ뱔</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thàn-goà yâh-siàu-lién koâ̰-kîn-lai-phâh-pia̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿! <ruby>再會<rt>재ˋ훼ˉ</rt></ruby>’밯!\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh! jài-huē’pah!\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿! <ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh! siâ̰-mîh lông-m-kiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿! <ruby>再會<rt>재ˋ훼ˉ</rt></ruby>’밯!\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh! jài-huē’pah!\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿! <ruby>向前行<rt>형ˋ졘걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh! hiòng-jien-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>台北<rt>대박ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>台北<rt>대박ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>台北車頭<rt>대박ˆ챠ˉᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>到<rt>ᄀᅷ</rt></ruby>’렇랗\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tai-pâk-tai-pâk-tai-pâk-chiā-tháu kau’lorh-lah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>落車<rt>롷챠ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>旅客<rt>루ˆ켛</rt></ruby> <ruby>請<rt>챨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>趕緊<rt>괄ˆ긴ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>落車<rt>롷챠ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bêh-loh-chiâ’e lû-kheh chiâ̰-koâ̰-kîn-loh-chiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>頭前<rt>ᄐᅷ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>現代<rt>혠대</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>台北車頭<rt>대박ˆ챠ˉᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thau-jiéng si-hien-tai’e tai-pâk-chiā-tháu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>理想<rt>리ˆ셩ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>希望<rt>히ˉ빵ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>쟈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà’e lî-siòng kâh-hī-bāng lông-ti-jiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一棟<rt>짇덩ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一棟<rt>짇덩</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>高樓大廈<rt>ㄍㄠㄌㄡˊㄉㄚˋㄒㄧㄚˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-tòng-jit-tong’e <i>gāo lóu dà xià</i>\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>蹛<rt>돠ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄-</rt></ruby><ruby>像<rt>츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>種<rt>졍ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>慐囝<rt>껑걀ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-jāi-u-toà-roa-joe-chiṵ-goâ-jît-jiòng’e gong-kià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>較<rt>캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>早<rt>자ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>聽人唱<rt>턀ˉ랑츌ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>台北<rt>ㄊㄞˊㄅㄟˇ</rt></ruby><ruby>不是<rt>ㄅㄨˋㄕˋ</rt></ruby><ruby>我的家<rt>ㄨㄛˇㄉㄜ˙ㄐㄧㄚ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khâh-jà thiā̰-lang-chiṵ̀-<em>tái běi bù shì wǒ de jiā</em>\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>但<rt>단-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一點仔<rt>짇댬ˆ아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>感覺<rt>감ˆ각</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tan-si-goà jit-tiâm-à lông-bo-kâm-kak\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿! <ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh! siâ̰-mîh lông-m-kiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿! <ruby>向前行<rt>형ˋ졘걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh! hiòng-jien-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿! <ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh! siâ̰-mîh lông-m-kiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿! <ruby>向前行<rt>형ˋ졘걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh! hiòng-jien-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<table class=\"wp-block-table alignleft\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;border: none;font-size: 16px\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td style=\"border: none;vertical-align: top;min-width: 5em;padding-right: 1.5em;padding-left: 0;padding-top: 0;padding-bottom: 0\">\n  <a href=\"#_ftnref1\" id=\"_ftn1\">¹</a>\n  <i>\n    <span><ruby>親情<rt>친ˉ쟐ˊ</rt></ruby></span>\n  </i> :\n</td>\n    <td style=\"border: none;padding: 0\">\n      (中) 親戚。<br>\n      (en) Relatives.\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<div style=\"clear: both;margin-bottom: 1em\"></div>\n"
